  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Do you have any plans for your study in the next five years?",
      "speaker": "a",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Honestly, I don't have a five-year plan — only a two or three-year one. So my plan is to improve my English speaking, from IELTS band 6 to band 8 or 8.5. Then I'd work as an IELTS teacher, teaching English to others — that way I keep improving my own English while earning money from it. And in the meantime, AI is developing so fast that I think everyone should learn it. So I'll also study AI and try to become an AI expert in the next few years.",
      "speaker": "b",
      "start": 2.86,
      "end": 28.21
    }
  ],
